Asia Industrial Gases Association. Good practices guide for loading and unloading of cryogenic liquid tankers, AIGA 040/15. [Association-hosted full publication](https://www.asiaiga.org/uploaded_docs/en_AIGA_040_15_Guide__loading_and_Unloading_of_Cryo_Liquid_Tankers.pdf).

Read the full guide to connect production storage, tanker logistics and customer bulk tanks, using its stated oxygen/nitrogen/argon and grade scope. Identify what each party must know at a transfer and which responsibilities cross the organizational boundary. Production/separation processes themselves are outside this guide's stated scope.

The official indexed document supplied its identity and scope on 29 October 2026; direct browser retrieval timed out, so full-page inspection and an unrestricted reuse licence are not claimed. Keep the association's actual publication notice and revision when consulting it. Gas-specific installation design and operating competence require the relevant complete technical programme. All source material remains external.

